<title>USA: Northwest Pipe wins mln pipe contract.</title>
<headline>Northwest Pipe wins mln pipe contract.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwest Pipe Co Friday announced a $22.5 million contract to suppy steel pipe to L.H. Woods &amp; Sons, Inc for the construction of a pipeline near Riverside, Calif.</p>
<p>Final approval is required from the local water district. When approved, work is expected to begin in the first quarter of 1998 and be completed by the end of 1998 or early in 1999.</p>
<p>Northwest Pipe shares closed up 1-7/8 at 21.</p>
</text>
